"{1}: {2}\n"
"稼働率: {3}%\n"
"下の階層に与える性能: ×{4}"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TIERS.HEADER_BONUS"
msgid "Performance: x{0} (built up: {1}, activity: {2}%)"
msgstr "性能: ×{0}(積み上げ: {1}、稼働率: {2}%)"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TIERS.PRODUCTION_RATE"
msgid "Build-up: +{0}/s"
msgstr "積み上げ: +{0}/秒"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_COMPUTEROOM.NAME"
msgid "Compute Room"
msgstr "計算機室"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_COMPUTEROOM.DESC"
msgid "A room of racks that keeps the Record Archive sharp."
msgstr "記録保管庫を鋭くし続ける、ラックの並ぶ部屋。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_COMPUTEROOM.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Builds up the performance of the Record Archive while running. Runs only while its cell is cool enough, and gives off more heat the more it is expanded.\n"
"\n"
"Its activity falls while stopped, but the built-up performance is kept."
msgstr ""
"稼働している間、記録保管庫の性能を積み上げる。周囲が十分に冷えていないと稼働しない。拡張するほど発熱が増える。\n"
"\n"
"停止中は稼働率が下がるが、積み上げた性能は失われない。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_VACUUMLAB.NAME"
msgid "Vacuum Lab"
msgstr "真空実験室"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_VACUUMLAB.DESC"
msgid "A sealed laboratory where experiments need nothing in the way."
msgstr "邪魔するものが何もない環境で実験を行う、密閉された研究室。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.IR_VACUUMLAB.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Builds up the performance of the Compute Room while running. Runs only when every cell it occupies is thin enough.\n"
"\n"
"Its activity falls while stopped, but the built-up performance is kept."
msgstr ""
"稼働している間、計算機室の性能を積み上げる。占めるすべてのセルの気体が十分に薄くないと稼働しない。\n"
"\n"
"停止中は稼働率が下がるが、積み上げた性能は失われない。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE7_TITLE"
msgid "Blueprint: Compute Room"
msgstr "設計図: 計算機室"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE7_BODY"
msgid ""
"<b>God Does Arithmetic (Because It Was Outsourced!)</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>Calculation is inseparable from the pursuit of knowledge. Yet there is only so much a notebook can hold, and it is exhausting to keep the pen moving. The Duplicants seem to have decided to wait instead for an -oracle- to descend from a machine far wiser than themselves.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"The act of calculating is not labor. It is art.\"  - Albert L. Davoski</i>\n"
"\n"
"The Record Archive has been expanded far enough to draw up the next facility. The Compute Room (Equipment menu, Research tab) is now available. Build it from steel and keep its room at 30 C or below (it gives off more heat the more you expand it): while it runs, it builds up the performance of the Record Archive. If it stops, its activity falls and the performance fades toward x1, but nothing built up is lost."
msgstr ""
"<b>神は算術をなさる(外注されたから！)</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>知的探究に計算はつきものです。とはいえ、ノートに書ける数式には限りがあり、ペンを走らせ続けるのは骨が折れます。複製人間たちは今や自身より遥かに賢い機械からの-神託-が降りてくるのを待つことにしたようです。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"「何かを計算する、という行為は、作業ではなくアートである」　―アルベルト・L・ダヴォスキー</i>\n"
"\n"
"記録保管庫を十分に拡張したので、次の設備の設計図が完成しました。計算機室(設備メニューの研究タブ)を建てられるようになります。鋼鉄で建設し、部屋を30℃以下に保ってください(拡張するほど発熱が増えます)。稼働している間、記録保管庫の性能を積み上げます。止まると稼働率が下がって性能は1倍に近づきますが、積み上げた分は失われません。"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE8_TITLE"
msgid "Blueprint: Vacuum Lab"
msgstr "設計図: 真空実験室"

msgctxt "IncrementalResearch.STRINGS.UI.TUTORIAL.STAGE8_BODY"
msgid ""
"<b>Duplicants Love a Vacuum</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>Is there something \"in\" a vacuum? Whatever the philosophers say, the hole of a giant donut is perfect for all manner of research. It would be far more unnatural to dislike such a convenient thing. At any rate, a room packed with vacuum like sardines should fill our tin cans with Insight as well.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\"Make the air clean. Yes, take it out.\"  - Albert L. Davoski</i>\n"
"\n"
"The Compute Room has been expanded far enough to draw up the next facility. The Vacuum Lab (Equipment menu, Research tab) is now available. It needs a vacuum around it, and heat does not escape in a vacuum, so mind its temperature. While it runs, it builds up the performance of the Compute Room."
msgstr ""
"<b>複製人間は真空がお好き</b>\n"
"\n"
"<i>真空空間には何かが「ある」のでしょうか。巨大なドーナツの穴は、哲学的見地に関わらず、諸々の研究にうってつけです。こんな便利なものを嫌うほうがよほど不自然というものでしょう。ともかく、イワシのごとく真空で満たされた部屋は、我々の缶詰をも知見で満たしてくれるはずです。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"「空気を綺麗にしてくれ。ああ、取り除くんだ」　―アルベルト・L・ダヴォスキー</i>\n"
"\n"
"計算機室を十分に拡張したので、次の設備の設計図が完成しました。真空実験室(設備メニューの研究タブ)を建てられるようになります。周囲が真空である必要がありますが、真空では熱が逃げにくいので、温度に注意してください。稼働している間、計算機室の性能を積み上げます。"
